{"id":"632990","name":"大拌菜","author":"厨色","authorId":"12901915","desc":"","cover":"images/632990/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"生菜","amount":"100克"},{"name":"樱桃","amount":"10颗"},{"name":"圣女果","amount":"6个"},{"name":"坚果","amount":"20克"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"},{"name":"南瓜","amount":"120克"}],"sub":[{"name":"熟芝麻","amount":"半勺"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"3瓣"},{"name":"玉米粒","amount":"1勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材准备好。","img":"images/632990/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"南瓜切块和鸡蛋一起上锅蒸熟。","img":"images/632990/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"生菜反复清洗干净，控干水分。","img":"images/632990/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"鸡蛋蒸熟切角，小番茄对半切开。","img":"images/632990/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"蒜切碎放入碗中，加入酱油和醋。","img":"images/632990/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入芝麻油和胡椒粉。","img":"images/632990/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入蚝油、果酱和熟芝麻拌匀。","img":"images/632990/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"生菜撕小块，放入盘子底部，上面放上蒸熟的南瓜和小番茄。","img":"images/632990/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入坚果和鸡蛋。","img":"images/632990/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"均匀撒上玉米粒。","img":"images/632990/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入樱桃。","img":"images/632990/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"淋入调好的料汁。","img":"images/632990/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"吃时拌匀即可。","img":"images/632990/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}